{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1017","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. The Wu"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Childan is making up a legendary story and trying to sell his forgery — a necklace with a strong sense of \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Wu"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" to the Kasouras. But Mr. Kasoura is challenging the truth of Childan's story. So he is going to ask a few questions about Childan's so-called \"personal treasure\" necklace."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"This \"personal treasure\" is a multiset $$$S$$$ of $$$m$$$ \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"01-strings"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"01-string"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" is a string that contains $$$n$$$ characters \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". For example, if $$$n=4$$$, strings \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0110"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0000"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1110"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" are \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"01-strings"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", but \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"00110"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (there are $$$5$$$ characters, not $$$4$$$) and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"zero"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (unallowed characters) are not."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that the multiset $$$S$$$ can contain equal elements."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Frequently, Mr. Kasoura will provide a \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"01-string"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" $$$t$$$ and ask Childan how many strings $$$s$$$ are in the multiset $$$S$$$ such that the \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Wu"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" value of the pair $$$(s, t)$$$ is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"not greater"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" than $$$k$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Mrs. Kasoura and Mr. Kasoura think that if $$$s_i = t_i$$$ ($$$1\\leq i\\leq n$$$) then the \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Wu"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" value of the character pair equals to $$$w_i$$$, otherwise $$$0$$$. The \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Wu"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" value of the \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"01-string"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" pair is the sum of the \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Wu"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" values of every character pair. Note that the length of every \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"01-string"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" is equal to $$$n$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, if $$$w=[4, 5, 3, 6]$$$, \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Wu"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" of (\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1001"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1100"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\") is $$$7$$$ because these strings have equal characters only on the first and third positions, so $$$w_1+w_3=4+3=7$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You need to help Childan to answer Mr. Kasoura's queries. That is to find the number of strings in the multiset $$$S$$$ such that the \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Wu"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" value of the pair is not greater than $$$k$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains three integers $$$n$$$, $$$m$$$, and $$$q$$$ ($$$1\\leq n\\leq 12$$$, $$$1\\leq q, m\\leq 5\\cdot 10^5$$$) — the length of the \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"01-strings"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", the size of the multiset $$$S$$$, and the number of queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$w_1, w_2, \\ldots, w_n$$$ ($$$0 \\le w_i \\le 100$$$) — the value of the $$$i$$$-th caracter."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of the next $$$m$$$ lines contains the \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"01-string"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" $$$s$$$ of length $$$n$$$ — the string in the multiset $$$S$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of the next $$$q$$$ lines contains the \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"01-string"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" $$$t$$$ of length $$$n$$$ and integer $$$k$$$ ($$$0\\leq k\\leq 100$$$) — the query."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each query, print the answer for this query."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2 4 5\n40 20\n01\n01\n10\n11\n00 20\n00 40\n11 20\n11 40\n11 60\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n4\n2\n3\n4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1 2 4\n100\n0\n1\n0 0\n0 100\n1 0\n1 100\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1\n2\n1\n2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example, we can get:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Wu"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" of (\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"01"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"00"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\") is $$$40$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Wu"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" of (\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"10"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"00"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\") is $$$20$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Wu"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" of (\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"11"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"00"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\") is $$$0$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Wu"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" of (\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"01"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"11"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\") is $$$20$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Wu"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" of (\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"10"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"11"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\") is $$$40$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Wu"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" of (\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"11"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"11"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\") is $$$60$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first query, pairs (\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"11"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"00"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\") and (\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"10"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"00"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\") satisfy the condition since their \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Wu"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" is not greater than $$$20$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second query, all strings satisfy the condition."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third query, pairs (\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"01"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"11"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\") and (\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"01"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"11"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\") satisfy the condition. Note that since there are two \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"01"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" strings in the multiset, the answer is $$$2$$$, not $$$1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the fourth query, since $$$k$$$ was increased, pair (\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"10"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"11"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\") satisfies the condition too."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the fifth query, since $$$k$$$ was increased, pair (\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"11"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"11"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\") satisfies the condition too."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"1017D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/con